{"id":"3f06c9fe86c236dd","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-syntax-interface.md","title":"Signatures and Typed Syntax Constructors","display":"df-syntax-interface — Signatures and Typed Syntax Constructors","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-syntax-interface","aliases":["67-df-syntax-interface"],"display":"df-syntax-interface — Signatures and Typed Syntax Constructors","depends_on":["[[67-df-recursive-function-class]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-syntax-interface"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-syntax-interface</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-syntax-interface — Signatures and Typed Syntax Constructors"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5f966a5415552b4e\" href=\"?note=5f966a5415552b4e\" title=\"67-df-recursive-function-class\">67-df-recursive-function-class</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>元理论为带选择公理的集合论；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，有限列是以某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为定义域的函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|s|=m\">\\(|s|=m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_i=s(i)\">\\(s_i=s(i)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s{}^\\frown t\">\\(s{}^\\frown t\\)</span> 为列连接。以下所有集合、有限树及函数均为元层对象。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=(F_L,R_L,a_L)\">\\(L=(F_L,R_L,a_L)\\)</span>；函数符号、关系符号及变量使用互不相交的标签，等号是逻辑符号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_L\">\\(a_L\\)</span> 给每个非逻辑符号有限元数；常元为零元函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sig}\">\\(\\mathsf{Sig}\\)</span> 是这样的签名所成的类，不作为集合量化的元素。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F_L\">\\(f\\in F_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in R_L\">\\(R\\in R_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\">\\(\\vec t\\)</span> 的长度必须等于相应元数。下列不同最外层标签保证各构造的值域不交，且每个构造为单射。</li>\n<li>“有效签名”另带从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_L\\cup R_L\">\\(F_L\\cup R_L\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 的单射符号编码，其像及元数函数可递归判定；要求 PR 句法时额外要求它们原始递归。计算类由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5f966a5415552b4e\" href=\"?note=5f966a5415552b4e\" title=\"67-df-recursive-function-class\">67-df-recursive-function-class</a> 给出；此附加条件不参与以下语法构造的集合定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sig}(L)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow F_L\\cap R_L=\\varnothing\\land a_L:F_L\\cup R_L\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubSig}(L,K)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nF_L\\subseteq F_K\\land R_L\\subseteq R_K\\land a_K\\upharpoonright(F_L\\cup R_L)=a_L,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SigIso}(\\rho,L,K)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\rho:F_L\\cup R_L\\xrightarrow{\\sim}F_K\\cup R_K\\land\\rho[F_L]=F_K\n\\land\\forall s\\in F_L\\cup R_L\\ (a_K(\\rho(s))=a_L(s)),\\\\\nL\\oplus_F(H,b)&amp;\\coloneqq(F_L\\cup H,R_L,a_L\\cup b)\n\\quad(H\\cap(F_L\\cup R_L)=\\varnothing\\land b:H\\to\\mathbb N),\\\\\nL\\oplus_R(H,b)&amp;\\coloneqq(F_L,R_L\\cup H,a_L\\cup b)\n\\quad(H\\cap(F_L\\cup R_L)=\\varnothing\\land b:H\\to\\mathbb N),\\\\\nv_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle,&amp;\\mathrm{Var}_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\nf(\\vec t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle1,f,\\vec t\\rangle,&amp;R(\\vec t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle2,R,\\vec t\\rangle,\\\\\n(t=u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle3,t,u\\rangle,&amp;\\neg\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle4,\\varphi\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle5,\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle,&amp;\\forall x\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle6,x,\\varphi\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sig}(L)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow F_L\\cap R_L=\\varnothing\\land a_L:F_L\\cup R_L\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubSig}(L,K)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nF_L\\subseteq F_K\\land R_L\\subseteq R_K\\land a_K\\upharpoonright(F_L\\cup R_L)=a_L,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SigIso}(\\rho,L,K)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\rho:F_L\\cup R_L\\xrightarrow{\\sim}F_K\\cup R_K\\land\\rho[F_L]=F_K\n\\land\\forall s\\in F_L\\cup R_L\\ (a_K(\\rho(s))=a_L(s)),\\\\\nL\\oplus_F(H,b)&amp;\\coloneqq(F_L\\cup H,R_L,a_L\\cup b)\n\\quad(H\\cap(F_L\\cup R_L)=\\varnothing\\land b:H\\to\\mathbb N),\\\\\nL\\oplus_R(H,b)&amp;\\coloneqq(F_L,R_L\\cup H,a_L\\cup b)\n\\quad(H\\cap(F_L\\cup R_L)=\\varnothing\\land b:H\\to\\mathbb N),\\\\\nv_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle,&amp;\\mathrm{Var}_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\nf(\\vec t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle1,f,\\vec t\\rangle,&amp;R(\\vec t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle2,R,\\vec t\\rangle,\\\\\n(t=u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle3,t,u\\rangle,&amp;\\neg\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle4,\\varphi\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle5,\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle,&amp;\\forall x\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle6,x,\\varphi\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条仅固定有限语法树及签名。有效性条件在使用编号、证明枚举的条目中另行满足；一般模型论签名不因此被限制为可计算签名。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"5f966a5415552b4e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"5f966a5415552b4e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"“有效签名”另带从 $F_L\\cup R_L$ 到 $\\mathbb N$ 的单射符号编码，其像及元数函数可递归判定；要求 PR 句法时额外要求它们原始递归。计算类由 [[67-df-recursive-function-class]] 给出；此附加条件不参与以下语法构造的集合定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"|s|=m","display":false},{"tex":"s_i=s(i)","display":false},{"tex":"s{}^\\frown t","display":false},{"tex":"L=(F_L,R_L,a_L)","display":false},{"tex":"a_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Sig}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F_L","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in R_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t","display":false},{"tex":"F_L\\cup R_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sig}(L)&\\Longleftrightarrow F_L\\cap R_L=\\varnothing\\land a_L:F_L\\cup R_L\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubSig}(L,K)&\\Longleftrightarrow\nF_L\\subseteq F_K\\land R_L\\subseteq R_K\\land a_K\\upharpoonright(F_L\\cup R_L)=a_L,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SigIso}(\\rho,L,K)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\rho:F_L\\cup R_L\\xrightarrow{\\sim}F_K\\cup R_K\\land\\rho[F_L]=F_K\n\\land\\forall s\\in F_L\\cup R_L\\ (a_K(\\rho(s))=a_L(s)),\\\\\nL\\oplus_F(H,b)&\\coloneqq(F_L\\cup H,R_L,a_L\\cup b)\n\\quad(H\\cap(F_L\\cup R_L)=\\varnothing\\land b:H\\to\\mathbb N),\\\\\nL\\oplus_R(H,b)&\\coloneqq(F_L,R_L\\cup H,a_L\\cup b)\n\\quad(H\\cap(F_L\\cup R_L)=\\varnothing\\land b:H\\to\\mathbb N),\\\\\nv_i&\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle,&\\mathrm{Var}_L&\\coloneqq\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\nf(\\vec t)&\\coloneqq\\langle1,f,\\vec t\\rangle,&R(\\vec t)&\\coloneqq\\langle2,R,\\vec t\\rangle,\\\\\n(t=u)&\\coloneqq\\langle3,t,u\\rangle,&\\neg\\varphi&\\coloneqq\\langle4,\\varphi\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&\\coloneqq\\langle5,\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle,&\\forall x\\varphi&\\coloneqq\\langle6,x,\\varphi\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2770,"backlinks":[{"id":"e5558885fabd8e01","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\sigma\\subseteq\\tau$ 缩写 $\\operatorname{SubSig}(\\sigma,\\tau)$，$\\rho:\\sigma\\cong\\tau$ 缩写 $\\operatorname{SigIso}(\\rho,\\sigma,\\tau)$；$|\\sigma|=|F_\\sigma\\cup R_\\sigma|$。$\\sigma\\cup\\{c^{(0)}\\}=\\sigma\\oplus_F(\\{c\\},\\{(c,0)\\})$，$\\sigma\\cup\\{P^{(1)}\\}=\\sigma\\oplus_R(\\{P\\},\\{(P,1)\\})$。这些记号均取 [[67-df-syntax-interface]]；结构操作取 [[67-df-isomorphism]]。"},{"id":"4c0e8087df7fe695","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ca49afa2dba90443","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为 [[67-df-syntax-interface]] 的签名。$x,y,z$ 遍历 $\\mathrm{Var}_L$；$i,j,m\\in\\mathbb N$。以下递归均按有限树或有限列的长度进行。"},{"id":"433a5a5e16d90414","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L,K$ 是有限有效一阶签名，均含实际等号；函数符号集、关系符号集与元数函数分别为 $F_L,R_L,a_L$。零元函数即常元，零元关系允许出现。变量表、公式集、指定自由变量接口、无捕获代入和全称闭包取 [[67-df-formula]] 与 [[67-df-syntax-interface]] 的相应语言实例；两语言变量用同一索引 $v_i$ 对应。可推导性取 [[67-df-prim-provability]]。"},{"id":"2aa449de50b1c012","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L,K$ 为 [[67-df-syntax-interface]] 的签名；结构及其解释族取 [[67-df-satisfaction]]。每个下列构造仅在其列明的输入类型上定义。"},{"id":"336238f06be8e591","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2fbf7ac563ea4261","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"除恒等分支外，$E_D$ 的递归式仅用于含有新增函数符号的输入；逻辑子式不含新增符号时立即使用恒等分支。$L_A\\oplus_F$ 取 [[67-df-syntax-interface]]。"},{"id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-syntax-interface]] — Signatures and Typed Syntax Constructors。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-syntax-interface]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-syntax-interface]]"}],"outgoing":["5f966a5415552b4e"]}